
=== Cypher Validator Tests ===

Read-only queries (should pass):
  PASS: Simple MATCH/RETURN
  PASS: Property contains "set" (lowercase in value)
  PASS: String literal contains CREATE keyword
  PASS: OPTIONAL MATCH with relationship traversal
  PASS: ORDER BY and LIMIT
  PASS: WITH and UNWIND

Write queries (should fail):
  PASS: CREATE node
  PASS: SET property
  PASS: DELETE node
  PASS: DETACH DELETE
  PASS: MERGE
  PASS: REMOVE property
  PASS: DROP INDEX
  PASS: LOAD CSV
  PASS: Mixed case CrEaTe

CALL gating — allowlisted procedures (should pass):
  PASS: CALL db.labels()
  PASS: CALL db.schema.visualization()
  PASS: CALL db.index.vector.queryNodes
  PASS: CALL db.index.fulltext.queryNodes
  PASS: Mixed case CALL DB.LABELS()
  PASS: String literal containing CALL apoc

CALL gating — non-allowlisted (should fail):
  PASS: CALL apoc.load.json
  PASS: CALL apoc.periodic.iterate
  PASS: CALL dbms.listConfig
  PASS: CALL dbms.components
  PASS: CALL { subquery }
  PASS: CALL { } IN TRANSACTIONS
  PASS: CALL db.createLabel (not allowlisted)
  PASS: Allowlisted CALL followed by disallowed CALL

Validator bypasses (W-E-9, should fail):
  PASS: B1 bypass refused: WITH "it's" AS a CREATE (n:X) RETURN 'z'
  PASS: B2 bypass refused: LOAD  CSV FROM "http://x" AS r RETURN r
  PASS: B3 bypass refused: SHOW USERS
  PASS: B4 bypass refused: MATCH (n) /* ' */ CREATE (m:X) /* ' */ RETURN 1
  PASS: B5 bypass refused: RETURN apoc.cypher.runFirstColumnSingle("CALL apoc.load.json('http://x') YIELD value RETURN value", {}) AS v
  PASS: B6 bypass refused: USE system MATCH (n) RETURN n
  PASS: B7 bypass refused: TERMINATE TRANSACTIONS "neo4j-transaction-1"
  PASS: B8 bypass refused: MATCH (n:`'`) CREATE (m:X) RETURN '`'
  PASS: B9 bypass refused: RETURN apoc.text.levenshteinSimilarityX('a', 'b')
  PASS: B10 bypass refused: RETURN apoc.textlevenshteinSimilarity('a', 'b')
  PASS: B11 bypass refused: RETURN apoc.text.clean(apoc.cypher.runFirstColumnSingle("RETURN 1", {})) AS v
  PASS: B12 bypass refused: RETURN apoc.cypher.runFirstColumnSingle /* a comment */ ("RETURN 1", {}) AS v
  PASS: B13 bypass refused: RETURN `apoc`.cypher.runFirstColumnSingle("RETURN 1", {}) AS v
  PASS: B14 bypass refused: RETURN apoc . cypher . runFirstColumnSingle("RETURN 1", {}) AS v
  PASS: B15 bypass refused: CALL apoc.text.clean('x')
  PASS: B16 bypass refused: RETURN APOC.TEXT.CLEAN('x')
  PASS: B17 bypass refused: RETURN apoc.`text`.clean(apoc.`cypher`.runFirstColumnSingle('RETURN 1', {}))

